From 674239b9426e1bb3a6423efd9fd38506ceec7079 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 03:24:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 001/488] soh: rename 18 address-named source files to what
 they contain

Eighteen files in soh/src/code/ were named after the ROM address of their first
function rather than after what they contain. Each is renamed to its subject,
cross-checked against zeldaret/oot's own layout. Content is untouched; only the
paths and the #include lines that reach them change.

  * code_800E6840.c -> audio_dcache.c

  * code_800EC960.c -> audio_general.c

  * code_800F9280.c -> audio_seq.c

  * code_800F7260.c -> audio_sfx.c

  * code_800C3C20.c -> audio_stop_all_sfx.c

  * code_800E4FE0.c -> audio_thread.c

  * code_800D31A0.c -> debug_ctrlr2.c

  * code_8006C3A0.c -> flags_env.c

  * code_801067F0.c -> math_fmod.c

  * code_801068B0.c -> memmove.c

  * code_800FD970.c -> rand.c

  * code_800FCE80.c -> sys_math_float.c

  * code_800D2E30.c -> sys_rumble.c

  * code_800FC620.c -> system_heap.c

  * code_800430A0.c -> z_bg_collect.c

  * code_800BB0A0.c -> z_cutscene_spline.c

  * code_8006C510.c -> z_fcurve_data.c

  * code_800A9F30.c -> z_rumble.c

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
